PARSFILE
#FullDataName Control: Speed (Closed Loop) Using Path Preview`0.2/0.2 G Max Ax/Ay Limits`
INSTALL_DRIVER_SPEED_CONTROLLER CarSim9
#RingCtrl0 2
OPT_SC_SKILL 2
#RingCtrl1 1
#RingCtrl2 1
#RingCtrl3 1
#RingCtrl4 1
#RingCtrl5 3
SPEED_TARGET_COMBINE ADD
SPEED_TARGET_CONSTANT 0
SPEED_AX_THROTTLE_CONSTANT 0.2
SPEED_AX_BRAKE_CONSTANT 0.2
SPEED_AY_LEFT_CONSTANT 0.2
SPEED_AY_RIGHT_CONSTANT 0.2
PARSFILE Control\Speed_s\SpdSta_130bda30-29b8-4ec0-842c-4a8bda56281d.par
#BlueLink4 Control: Speed (Closed Loop) vs. Station (Legacy)`Entry and Exit Speeds` ` , Speed vs. station`SpdSta_130bda30-29b8-4ec0-842c-4a8bda56281d

OPT_SC 4
#CheckBox0 1    
OPT_SC_ENGINE_BRAKING 1
#CheckBox1 0    
#CheckBox2 0    
OPT_SC_3D 0

SPEED_KP 0.5
SPEED_KI 0
SPEED_KP3 0.5
BK_PERF_SC 0.1
FPD_PERF_SC 0.1
SPEED_PREVIEW_STEP 4
SPEED_CURV_LENGTH 8
SPEED_PREVIEW_START 0
SPEED_PREVIEW 100
PBK_CON_MAX_SC 10

#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This setting was made for handling the roundabout. Each leg has station that starts at S = 0, enters a turn at S = 50 m, and exits at S = 100 m.
#
#The target speed is 80 km/h outside the roundabout, 30 km/h within the roundabout.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

LOG_ENTRY Used Dataset: Control: Speed (Closed Loop) Using Path Preview; 0.2/0.2 G Max Ax/Ay Limits
